lambdaFocus
#
# File: lambdaFocus.lut
#
# This file contains the lookup table describing how the best GMOS
# focus varies with wavelength, in terms of an offset from the focus
# measured at 650 nanometres. The GMOS software will interpolate
# between the entries in this table.
#
# Information from measurements by Morag Hastie, Chris Tierney and
# David Lee at UKATC on 5th August 2002.
#
# Wavelength (nm)  focus offset (microns)
#

365.0              -136.6
405.0                53.9
450.0               195.3
500.0               161.8
550.0               112.5
600.0                51.2
650.0                 0.0
700.0               -56.7
750.0               -95.6
800.0              -125.2
850.0              -145.5
900.0              -161.3
950.0              -167.2
1050.0             -159.9
